### IntelliJ HTTP Client - select the "local" environment (http-client.env.json)

### Authorise a payment (idempotent: re-run with the same key to see the 200 replay)
POST {{host}}/v1/payments
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1500, "currency": "GBP", "reference": "order-1001" }

> {% client.global.set("paymentId", response.body.id); %}

### Get it
GET {{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}

### Capture
POST {{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/capture

### Cancel (409 once captured)
POST {{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/cancel

### List, newest first
GET {{host}}/v1/payments?status=CAPTURED&limit=10

### Validation error -> 400 application/problem+json
POST {{host}}/v1/payments
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-0002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 0, "currency": "gbp", "reference": "" }

### Health, metrics, contract
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
###
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus
###
GET {{host}}/openapi/payments-api.yaml
